   520	> **`OPEN[B0-N4-REDUCIBLE-PI1]`.** The exact missing lemma is:
   521	>
   522	> *Let `D ⊂ C^2` be an irreducible affine plane curve whose normalisation is
   523	> `A^1` or `C^*` and all of whose affine branches are smooth. Is
   524	> `pi_1(C^2 - D)` abelian?*
   525	>
