   545	> everything proved here: `(mu,corr) = (2,0)+(1,1)` and `(2,1)+(1,0)`. Relaxing
   546	> Lemma 3.3 to `nu >= s - sum_l corr_l` and rerunning (3.2) gives
   547	> `2a - N - 1 + (N-2a)s + sum_p a_p <= 0` in the one-correction case, which is
