codex
The local number \(3\) does not classify the image curve. I found explicit desk-scale triple-cover germs with the same generic index \(2\) and special local degree \(3\), but with Puiseux types \((2,3)\), \((2,9)\), and even \((3,4)\). I’m adding those as non-attainment diagnostics, then the full fibre data will be used to show that none can coexist with the trivial dicritical.
