+of its \(s_0=1,c_0=1\) repair is
+
+\[
+ s_2=s_1=1,qquad l_2'\simeq l_1'\simeq\widetilde D\simeq\mathbf A^1,
+ \qquad c=1.                                                          \tag{3.1}
+\]
+
+Indeed, Orevkov Lemma 2.1 gives \(l_i'\simeq\mathbf A^1\), and either
