+ \chi_c(D-\Sigma)=2-c-\nu-\sigma,
+ \qquad
+ (N-a)\chi_c(D-\Sigma)=N-1-N\sigma+A.                                \tag{3.2}
+\]
+
+Putting \((N,a)=(5,2)\) gives
+
+\[
+ 3c+3\nu-2\sigma+A=2.                                                 \tag{3.3}
+\]
+
+With (3.1), this becomes the exact \(N=5\) aggregate
+
+\[
+ 3\nu+A=2\sigma-1.                                                    \tag{3.4}
+\]
+
