+  \(r_{p_*}=1\), its Milnor number is
+  \(\mu_{\mathrm{Mil}}(p_*)=2\delta_{p_*}\ge2\).  This Milnor number is
+  unrelated to Orevkov's \(\mu_x=3\).
+
