+\[
+ (X,Y)=(t^2,-2t^{3k}),                                                \tag{2.4}
+\]
+
+of Puiseux type \((2,3k)\).  The smooth target disc \(X=0\), transverse
+to its tangent, sees \(v\mapsto v^3\).  Consequently the ordinary cusp
+\((2,3)\), \((2,9)\), \((2,15)\), and so on all have the same displayed
+\((\mu_l,\mu_x)=(2,3)\) data.
