+   The source and statement audit is at proof 20--29, 63--72 and review
+   56--83, 321--337.  Official record/PDF:
+   <https://www.mathnet.ru/eng/im1571>.
+2. H. Żołądek, “An application of Newton--Puiseux charts to the
