+ \quad\text{hence}\quad d\eta(z)=0.                                  \tag{5.1}
+\]
+
+Since \(h_1\) is also an isomorphism,
+
+\[
+ d\phi_1(x_1)=d\eta(z)\,dh_1(x_1)=0,                                 \tag{5.2}
+\]
+
